<Layout title="Meetups & Events — GHL Bangladesh"><section class="page-hero wrap"><span class="eyebrow">MEETUPS. IDEAS. REAL CONVERSATIONS.</span><h1>Good things happen<br/><em>when we show up.</em></h1><p>Step away from the screen. Meet the people behind the profiles, share what you’re learning, and leave with a fresh perspective.</p></section><section class="events-section section"><div class="wrap event-feature"><a href="/events/meetup-2026" class="event-image"><Photo name="meetup" alt="GHL Bangladesh meetup participants gathered together" eager/><span class="image-label">COMMUNITY GATHERING · 2026</span></a><div class="event-content"><span class="eyebrow">FROM THE COMMUNITY</span><h2>GHL Meetup<br/><em>Bangladesh 2026</em></h2><p style="margin-top:25px">A look inside a gathering of Bangladesh’s GHL community, through the people and moments that brought it to life.</p><a class="text-link" href="/events/meetup-2026">View the meetup gallery ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="section wrap split-content"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE NEXT CHAPTER</span><h2>More conversations.<br/><em>More connections.</em></h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">The next gathering starts with our community.</p><p>Dates, venues, and registration details will be shared once confirmed. Join the Facebook group to follow announcements and help shape the conversations you’d like to have.</p><a class="button" href={groupUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow event updates ↗</a></div></section><Join/></Layout>
